<title>CHINA: Rubber Belt 96 net down 17.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Rubber Belt 96 net down 17.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of yuan unless stated, against 1995 figures)</p>
<p> Turnover	  290.30	  vs    210.99</p>
<p> Net profit	  8.20	  vs	9.99</p>
<p> Asset per share    2.34 yuan  vs     2.15 yuan</p>
<p> Earnings per share 0.09 yuan  vs     0.11 yuan</p>
<p>Company name: Shanghai Rubber Belt Co Ltd</p>
<p>Note: the results were released in a company statement on Tuesday. The numbers are based on domestic accounting standards. Figures based on international accounting standards were not available.</p>
<p>The company's board of directors proposed 1.5-for-10 bonus issue, pending approval of a shareholders' meeting.</p>
</text>
